NOTICE — Third-Party Source Code Ownership
==========================================

mc-developing-mcp is a query tool and indexing system. It builds SQLite databases
from publicly available Java source code for the purpose of enabling AI-assisted
Minecraft mod development. The databases distributed with this project contain
indexed metadata (class names, method signatures, field names, documentation text)
derived from the projects listed below.

ALL RIGHTS TO THE FOLLOWING SOURCE CODE AND THEIR DERIVATIVES ARE RESERVED BY
THEIR RESPECTIVE OWNERS. mc-developing-mcp makes no claim of ownership over any
third-party source code, asset, or intellectual property listed here.

